    for electric vehicles. It searches for registered vehicles matching the
    make/model and extracts the official WLTP range.
    
    Args:
        make: Vehicle make (e.g., "Volvo", "Tesla")
        model: Vehicle model (e.g., "XC40", "Model 3")
